{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:58:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2115005324520575201"],"id":"2115005324520575201","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":252,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2115003481220391288","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🤣 卧槽！上电视了家人们，去观猹大会被 @woniuxuezhang  蜗牛学长抓住采访了，听说我是 X 万粉博主直接掏出麦克风 0 帧起手：出海出海出海！太有感染力了\n\n推荐关注蜗牛学长，国内自媒体做得风生水起，非常值得学习，我们也蒸馏一下蜗牛学长！ https://t.co/xliBRT6YYi","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2115005324520575201"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114986067329953792","3_2114986391319019520"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:44:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114986628527841701"],"id":"2114986628527841701","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":898,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114883723930030505","type":"quoted"}],"text":"😮 我自己配置好转头忘了这个功能，有新人进群，突然来了一句我才反应过来，感觉还挺智能的，哈哈哈哈哈\n\n感觉 Grok @bot  和微信机器人非常搭，还在开发新玩法，你们有没有想到啥好玩的，我来测试 https://t.co/ck56Pt58Yv https://t.co/hKiPUqlZfx","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114986628527841701"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T02:44:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114911167357550997"],"id":"2114911167357550997","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":1653,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114909810026319931","type":"quoted"}],"text":"👍 非常真实， @ama_huangama 黄啊码老师是真的在教 FDE，把落地最难的部分揭露给你看，我在做的项目就是每一条都有亲身体会\n\n非常反感那种粉饰太平，告诉你会 WorkBuddy 你就能做 FDE 的坑人教程。等你真接项目了才发现，这和网上说的也不一样啊，怎么这么难，最后浪费了时间，搞坏了自己的名声 https://t.co/WwrTIgNCTk","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114911167357550997"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T02:28:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114907079345607134"],"id":"2114907079345607134","in_reply_to_user_id":"1997889576187387904","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":307,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114899885174743118","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"可以定制一下，要求复盘文长度，格式排版","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114907079345607134"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T02:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114899885174743118"],"id":"2114899885174743118","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":3431,"like_count":41,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":32,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113798377494442291","type":"quoted"}],"text":"😨 淦！我在发一种很新的万粉复盘！更加 AI Native 的万粉复盘！\n\n达到万粉已经快一周了，我的万粉复盘还没憋出来，我很焦虑，因为已经有太多的复盘长文了，有几位老师的优秀长文珠玉在前，我都不知道写啥了\n\n所以我决定给大家一份提示词，直接把这个帖子复制链接发给 Grok，Grok https://t.co/ddAUPNDAH5","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114899885174743118"},{"created_at":"2026-10-27T01:49:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114897283842257058"],"id":"2114897283842257058","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":893,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114880431598543239","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📢 好消息好消息！为庆祝 Anthropic IPO 上市，恰逢双十一，特开启百亿补贴活动！\n\n有下面几种参与活动的方式：\n\n1️⃣ 家宽 + 本地流量防侧漏 + 提心吊胆\n2️⃣ 在国外允许区域 租一台 Mac Mini + 提心吊胆\n\n🤣 对了忘记说了，是你补贴 Anthropic，因为你被封禁的账号是它的收入，还是纯利！ https://t.co/wMEYgTUKbB","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114897283842257058"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114878381540229120","3_2114882225900748800","3_2114882302471962624"]},"created_at":"2026-10-27T00:55:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114883723930030505"],"id":"2114883723930030505","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2580,"like_count":31,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":21,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113798377494442291","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🎉 答疑群运维助手“小铁柱”上线！终于把自动化日报给整上了\n\n整体架构为：\n\n接收群聊消息存储 =&gt; Grok Bot 处理 =&gt; 微信通信渠道发送\n\n我没有设计成所有人都可以和 Bot 沟通，这样群聊内容反而更乱，只是作为一个自动发送的渠道，定时发送资讯，日报整理等内容，只响应我@它的消息 https://t.co/7EA0lX25PQ https://t.co/ddAUPNDAH5","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114883723930030505"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T15:49:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114746182396436949"],"id":"2114746182396436949","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1361,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114670876050460994","type":"quoted"}],"text":"无形大手让我损失 50 块！最后还是花钱更换了搬瓦工 IP，希望不要天天搞，这成本太高了 https://t.co/FWuOMhi9kJ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114746182396436949"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T14:59:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114733663132983654"],"id":"2114733663132983654","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":928,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114705042817110293","type":"quoted"}],"text":"卧槽💥Anthropic 拟在 Nasdaq 上市（代码 ANT），有望成史上最大规模 IPO 之一。\n\n另一边是 DeepSeek 媒体报道完成约千亿产业资本交割。\n\n新一轮模型竞赛要开始了，加油啊！平价平等的智能我觉得还得看 DeepSeek！ https://t.co/LHj5qzDD7X","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114733663132983654"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114720312369856512"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114720826268553457"],"id":"2114720826268553457","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1349,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"⚠️ 注意 Grok Bot 的 Webhook 是有触发限制的，注意控制频率，目前测试是一小时200 次，而且不是准点刷新，是类似 Codex 5 小时订阅的计时策略\n\n合理安排自己的触发频率，避免因为这个频率受限导致中断 https://t.co/zna7CZFKsl","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114720826268553457"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T14:01:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114718951355896171"],"id":"2114718951355896171","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1152,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114648961399349608","type":"quoted"}],"text":"成熟的企业架构搬进 Grok @bot 也适用！八种组织形态直接帮大家省去了多 Bot 配合无序碰壁的时间。\n\n上周 Space 我提到的主从模式和临时文章小组被庞老师归纳成了极其扎实的落地方案，可以直接借鉴参考。\n\n可以聊聊大家目前在自己的工作流里，最常用的是哪一种架构 https://t.co/TnrB505Rxq","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114718951355896171"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114670863475978240"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T10:50:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114670876050460994"],"id":"2114670876050460994","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":3177,"like_count":10,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109226370891194565","type":"quoted"}],"text":"😫今天搬瓦工的 IP 被墙了，又麻烦 网络管家 Bot 出马修复了，要登录搬瓦工的管理后台换 IP + 迁移，直接登录，并且从我的 Gmail 邮箱里拿到了验证码，不用自己操作什么，太方便了\n\n不过搬瓦工的 IP 也这么容易被墙么，你们有遇到这个情况吗？ https://t.co/BeftHHT4TH https://t.co/OemiJqQzXK","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114670876050460994"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T08:31:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114636116573950370"],"id":"2114636116573950370","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1308,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114624517528273026","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🤯这段对话把我答疑群的价值拉高了一截，缘起是有同学问怎么搭建个人知识库，大家讨论的时候司徒老师分享了自己的观点\n\n其中有个点我感触很深，也是自己纠结了很长时间才确定的，就是如果自己不看知识库内容，其实 obsidian 不是必须用的。就完全交给 Agent 来维护知识库，文件夹+md https://t.co/c3CERb2I0M","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114636116573950370"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T07:34:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114621754379554896"],"id":"2114621754379554896","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1392,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114602910797709607","type":"quoted"}],"text":"👍不得不说太全了，做企业 AI 落地的人通读一遍能少走很多弯路。结合我们在做的 FDE 项目，普遍最耽误推进的核心就是跟甲方的人沟通需求，外加繁重的数据清洗。\n\nFDE 的终点是让业务消费数据，但大部分工时其实都耗在准备数据上了。 https://t.co/SQoaztJblT","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114621754379554896"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T05:43:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114593745928917089"],"id":"2114593745928917089","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1320,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114326060477436015","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🎉 最近私聊催我分享三个月跑出万粉经验的同学很多。除了在垂类里持续投入，我最庆幸的是刚起步迷茫那阵子，有 @bbkirstry 小晚老师拉了我一把。\n\n和小晚老师几次线下碰面畅聊并得到私聊指点后，我才摸清了发力方向，顺着实践拿到了还不错的结果。推荐大家多关注小晚老师。 https://t.co/B7uKpnG51C","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114593745928917089"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:03:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114568582889914739"],"id":"2114568582889914739","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1957,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114365361068138990","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🎉 棒！又是一个实用功能，老马确认 Grok Bot 能替用户给个人或商家打电话了，代提请求、记录答复并回传摘要，等于在 Bot 调度里补齐了电话节点。\n\n1️⃣ 适合丢给电话节点的事：餐厅订座改期、催物流工单回执或问商户营业时间这类标准事项，开口直接给具体要求与时间底线即可。\n2️⃣ https://t.co/lwtssynsa7","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114568582889914739"},{"created_at":"2026-10-26T02:51:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114550331853922620"],"id":"2114550331853922620","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":3298,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114499611465236500","type":"quoted"}],"text":"👍 好家伙，木渡川老师这套 Harness 架构把多 Bot 协作最头疼的版本断层和并发写冲突直接解决了。\n\n把共用规则抽成独立底座，从 AGENTS.md 入口红线到版本对齐方方面面都考虑到了，非常详细而且能直接实操。建议直接发给你的 Grok @bot 参考优化，照着把规则底座搭起来，构建你自己的 Grok Bot 舰队。 https://t.co/bI1dnATlbU","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114550331853922620"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114547537965379584"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T02:46:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114549129452159172"],"id":"2114549129452159172","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5260,"like_count":19,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"😨 天网来了也得工信部备案，还得到人社部给所有终结者办理社保 https://t.co/Fm2xh2SJHt","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114549129452159172"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114529132772265984","3_2114529149004173312"]},"created_at":"2026-10-26T01:29:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114529773854793810"],"id":"2114529773854793810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":9287,"like_count":63,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2080452247893463550","type":"quoted"}],"text":"😱 卧槽！最近 @yetone 开发维护的爆火开源项目 magpie，竟然支持了 Grok App！很荣幸我做的小项目能得到支持！\n\n从支持列表里看到 Grok App 的时候还不敢相信，以为是重名了，然后在仓库内搜索关键字，在注释里看到确实是我的开源项目，打卡留念一下\n\nmagpie 开源仓库：\nhttps://t.co/TUuw9BZ2jM https://t.co/8J7IIYw6iM https://t.co/DjhMmB0Zn5","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114529773854793810"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114375654959640576","3_2114375664782692352"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T15:19:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114376206716154085"],"id":"2114376206716154085","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":906,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114249976331305147","type":"quoted"}],"text":"【微信小技巧】微信如果有没接收的转账和红包，会一直展示这个红色的标签，而且会时不时提醒你\n\n去掉这个标签最简单的办法是领取，接收转账，但是有些情况不能接收，就可以右键删除掉卡片，这样外面的标签就会清除掉了 https://t.co/W7tkUzS0VD https://t.co/n3wLPwOoYd","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114376206716154085"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114367562700193792"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T14:44:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114367571675992454"],"id":"2114367571675992454","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":2179,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114352273614921992","type":"quoted"}],"text":"卧槽！凡哥新产品完成度非常高，我采访了一下凡哥，这个产品的 v2 版本是完全交给 Grok @bot 操刀，从设计到开发，从上线到运营，全是 Bot 干的！\nBot 得用啊，太提效了！ https://t.co/LHDnsKY3mu https://t.co/uWdketPoMZ","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114367571675992454"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T10:02:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114296458572927330"],"id":"2114296458572927330","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2512,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114286757395189989","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🤣有同学看我的文章开始用快捷指令搭建工作流了，薄肌+Bot，这不火都难啊，哈哈哈哈哈 https://t.co/gZYGfmJ93g","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114296458572927330"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T08:50:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114278405730660481"],"id":"2114278405730660481","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":6865,"like_count":24,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108504325609984233","type":"quoted"}],"text":"🥵Grok @bot 额度不够用的看这里！如果按我的额度抠门大法优化完，觉得必须做的事情没做完，额度不够了，就说明要升订阅了⬇️ https://t.co/bIvVLTpsYr","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114278405730660481"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T06:57:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114249976331305147"],"id":"2114249976331305147","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":36174,"like_count":61,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":68,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🤔你们说腾讯会不会来一招\n\n只有 WorkBuddy 可以读取微信聊天记录？","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114249976331305147"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T06:53:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114248976371470647"],"id":"2114248976371470647","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1123,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114217410823688573","type":"quoted"}],"text":"😭！我倒在成功前，我已经通过快捷指令完成了大部分流程，没有在辅助功能注意到这个语音触发的方式\n看来不止我在研究快捷指令和 Grok @bot 的结合，还有很多玩法可以开拓 https://t.co/PVFLn0h1nk","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114248976371470647"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_2114986067329953792","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114986391319019520","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114878381540229120","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114882225900748800","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114882302471962624","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114720312369856512","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114670863475978240","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114547537965379584","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114529132772265984","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114529149004173312","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114375654959640576","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114375664782692352","type":"photo"},{"media_key":"3_2114367562700193792","type":"photo"}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2115005324520575201","next_token":"7140dibdnow9c7btwp0g75yxaamhfovo6dq53dgmdj7zr","oldest_id":"2114248976371470647","result_count":25}}